  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "Inside the cabin, a passenger opens an overhead bin with luggage inside. In business class, the seats are wide and comfortable. A traveler eats a meal from a plate, while another seat holds a pillow and a blanket. Behind a curtain, economy class has narrow seats arranged in rows. One flight attendant serves a tray to a passenger beside a cart. The cart holds water, juice, and more meals. Another flight attendant pours juice into a cup. A passenger wears headphones and drinks from his cup. A magazine sits in a pocket below a screen. Clouds fill the view through each window, and the wing and engine are outside the cabin.",
    "textZh": "在機艙內，一位乘客打開上方放著行李的行李艙。商務艙的座位寬敞又舒適。一位旅客吃著盤中的餐點，另一張座位上放著枕頭與毯子。隔簾後方的經濟艙，較窄的座椅一排排排列。一位空服員在餐車旁，將托盤遞給乘客。餐車上放著水、果汁與更多餐點。另一位空服員把果汁倒進杯子。一位乘客戴著耳機，用杯子喝飲料。螢幕下方的口袋裡放著一本雜誌。透過窗戶可以看見雲，機翼與引擎則位於機艙外。",
